3. What AuthClaw Is (in plain terms)

AuthClaw is delivered as three connected capabilities. A useful analogy: it works like a combination
of a security scanner at an airport, a knowledgeable compliance officer, and a black-box flight
recorder — applied to a company's use of AI.

Capability                 What it does, in plain English                                  Business benefit

1. The Safety              Every message going to or from an AI model passes through       Prevents data leaks and
Checkpoint                 AuthClaw first. It automatically detects and removes sensitive  policy breaches in real
("Gateway")                information (names, health data, card numbers) and blocks       time.
                           anything that breaks company rules — before it ever leaves
2. The Compliance          the building.                                                   Turns weeks of manual
Assistant                                                                                  compliance work into
("Agent")                  An AI assistant that scans the company's systems, explains in   guided, approved
                           clear language where it falls short of GDPR / HIPAA / SOC 2,    actions.
3. The Audit Recorder      and proposes fixes. Crucially, it never makes a risky change
("Audit Trail")            on its own — a human must approve each one, with a              Replaces manual
