5. Market Opportunity

AI governance is an early but fast-growing market. Independent analysts disagree on the exact size
— a normal sign of a young category — but they agree on the shape: small today, expanding
rapidly, multi-billion-dollar within a few years.

Analyst (2026)                    2026 size (approx.)     Growth (CAGR)  Outlook

Research & Markets                ~US$0.6 billion         ~44%           ~US$2.6 billion by 2030

Mordor Intelligence               ~US$0.44 billion        ~28%           ~US$1.5 billion by 2031

Coherent Market Insights          ~US$0.4 billion (2025)  ~47%           ~US$6.0 billion by 2032

Grand View Research               ~US$0.31 billion (2025) ~36%           ~US$3.6 billion by 2033

Figures are independent third-party estimates as of early 2026 and are indicative, not guarantees. The consistent message: double-
digit-to-~45% annual growth and a multi-billion-dollar market within roughly five years.

The fastest-growing slices are exactly where AuthClaw is strong: healthcare and life sciences,
financial services, and any organisation deploying generative AI that must prove it is safe. Spending
starts with large enterprises but is broadening to mid-sized companies as cloud-based tools lower
the barrier.

