AuthClaw's wedge: the runtime layer

Vanta proves you were compliant. Giskard tests whether your AI is safe. Securiti maps your data.

AuthClaw is the live layer that enforces safety in the moment, fixes gaps with human
approval, and records the proof — combining the strongest parts of all three into a single
product positioned at the point where AI is actually used.

