14. Strategic Fit

AuthClaw is a natural extension of the AgentsArchitects portfolio. Our existing platforms
already help enterprises adopt AI; AuthClaw lets them adopt it safely and prove it. It deepens our
position in the enterprise AI value chain and adds a recurring-revenue software product to a portfolio
aimed at reaching billion-dollar scale before 2030.

It also reinforces our credibility: a company that builds AI compliance software is, by definition,
demonstrating compliance leadership to every enterprise buyer it meets.

